{"seq":1,"slug":"oscillator-synthesis","title":"振荡器合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/synthesis/oscillator-synthesis","wordCount":1267,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"振荡器合成\">振荡器合成</h1><p>前面所有的源都是「把已有的声音引进图」——文件、标签、麦克风。振荡器不一样：它凭空生成声音，靠的只是数学。给它一个频率，它就按一条波形函数不断吐出采样，于是有了音调。一台合成器、一段提示音、游戏里的激光声、网页上的程序化音乐，源头都是这个不起眼的 OscillatorNode。这一节讲怎么用它从最纯的正弦波，一路搭到有血有肉、有起伏有音色的乐音——合成的全部乐趣都在「让冷冰冰的数学波形听起来像个东西」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>OscillatorNode</code> 由两个 AudioParam 和一个波形类型定义：<code>frequency</code>（基频，决定音高，Hz）、<code>detune</code>（在基频上微调，单位音分 cent，100 cent = 半音）、<code>type</code>（波形）。它和 <a href=\"../nodes/source-nodes\">源节点</a> 里的 buffer source 一样是一次性的——<code>start()</code> 只能调一次，停了就废。</p>\n<p>四种内置波形覆盖了合成的基本调色板：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  OSC[&quot;OscillatorNode&quot;] --&gt; T1[&quot;sine 正弦&lt;br/&gt;纯净·只有基频&quot;]&#10;  OSC --&gt; T2[&quot;square 方波&lt;br/&gt;明亮·奇次谐波·复古游戏&quot;]&#10;  OSC --&gt; T3[&quot;sawtooth 锯齿&lt;br/&gt;丰满·全谐波·弦乐/bass&quot;]&#10;  OSC --&gt; T4[&quot;triangle 三角&lt;br/&gt;柔和·弱奇次谐波&quot;]&#10;  OSC --&gt; T5[&quot;custom 自定义&lt;br/&gt;PeriodicWave 任意谐波&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  OSC[\"OscillatorNode\"] --&gt; T1[\"sine 正弦&lt;br/&gt;纯净·只有基频\"]\n  OSC --&gt; T2[\"square 方波&lt;br/&gt;明亮·奇次谐波·复古游戏\"]\n  OSC --&gt; T3[\"sawtooth 锯齿&lt;br/&gt;丰满·全谐波·弦乐/bass\"]\n  OSC --&gt; T4[\"triangle 三角&lt;br/&gt;柔和·弱奇次谐波\"]\n  OSC --&gt; T5[\"custom 自定义&lt;br/&gt;PeriodicWave 任意谐波\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波形</th>\n<th>谐波内容</th>\n<th>听感</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>sine</code></td>\n<td>仅基频</td>\n<td>纯净、单薄</td>\n<td>提示音、副振荡、调制源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>square</code></td>\n<td>奇次谐波</td>\n<td>明亮、空洞</td>\n<td>8-bit 复古、脉冲音色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sawtooth</code></td>\n<td>全部谐波</td>\n<td>丰满、嘹亮</td>\n<td>弦乐、铜管、bass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>triangle</code></td>\n<td>弱奇次谐波</td>\n<td>柔和、圆润</td>\n<td>长笛类、柔和 bass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>custom</code></td>\n<td>你指定的谐波</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>加法合成、还原真实乐器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>音高与频率的关系是对数的：每升高一个八度频率翻倍。十二平均律下，从基准音（A4 = 440 Hz）算第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个半音的频率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>440</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = 440 \\cdot 2^{n/12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">440</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这条公式让你能用代码把「C、E、G」这样的音名转成具体频率，是程序化音乐的基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"function noteToFreq(semitonesFromA4) {&#10;  return 440 * Math.pow(2, semitonesFromA4 / 12);&#10;}&#10;function tone(freq, type = &#39;sine&#39;, dur = 0.5) {&#10;  const osc = ctx.createOscillator();&#10;  osc.type = type;&#10;  osc.frequency.value = freq;&#10;  const env = ctx.createGain(); // 没有包络会&quot;啪&quot;地切，必须配&#10;  osc.connect(env).connect(ctx.destination);&#10;  // ADSR 见下一节&#10;  osc.start();&#10;  osc.stop(ctx.currentTime + dur);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function noteToFreq(semitonesFromA4) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return 440 * Math.pow(2, semitonesFromA4 / 12);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function tone(freq, type = 'sine', dur = 0.5) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const osc = ctx.createOscillator();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  osc.type = type;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  osc.frequency.value = freq;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const env = ctx.createGain(); // 没有包络会\"啪\"地切，必须配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  osc.connect(env).connect(ctx.destination);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // ADSR 见下一节</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  osc.start();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  osc.stop(ctx.currentTime + dur);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"包络-让音符有生命\">包络：让音符有生命</h2><p>一个裸振荡器 <code>start</code>/<code>stop</code> 听起来像电话忙音——突然开、突然关，毫无表情，而且开关瞬间的幅度跳变还会爆出咔嗒声。真实乐器的音符都有<strong>包络</strong>：钢琴敲下去瞬间最响（起音 Attack），然后衰减（Decay）到一个保持电平（延音 Sustain），松手后慢慢消失（释放 Release）。这套 ADSR 包络用一个 GainNode 配 AudioParam 自动化画出来（自动化方法见 <a href=\"../foundations/audio-graph-model\">音频图模型</a>，GainNode 的渐变防爆音见 <a href=\"../nodes/gain-filter-nodes\">增益与滤波节点</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"function playNote(freq, { a = 0.01, d = 0.1, s = 0.6, r = 0.3, dur = 0.8 } = {}) {&#10;  const now = ctx.currentTime;&#10;  const osc = ctx.createOscillator();&#10;  const env = ctx.createGain();&#10;  osc.frequency.value = freq;&#10;  osc.connect(env).connect(ctx.destination);&#10;&#10;  const g = env.gain;&#10;  g.setValueAtTime(0, now);&#10;  g.linearRampToValueAtTime(1, now + a); // A: 冲到峰值&#10;  g.linearRampToValueAtTime(s, now + a + d); // D: 落到延音电平&#10;  // S: 保持 s，直到 release 开始&#10;  g.setValueAtTime(s, now + dur);&#10;  g.linearRampToValueAtTime(0, now + dur + r); // R: 释放消失&#10;&#10;  osc.start(now);&#10;  osc.stop(now + dur + r + 0.01);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function playNote(freq, { a = 0.01, d = 0.1, s = 0.6, r = 0.3, dur = 0.8 } = {}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const now = ctx.currentTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const osc = ctx.createOscillator();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const env = ctx.createGain();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  osc.frequency.value = freq;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  osc.connect(env).connect(ctx.destination);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const g = env.gain;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  g.setValueAtTime(0, now);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  g.linearRampToValueAtTime(1, now + a); // A: 冲到峰值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  g.linearRampToValueAtTime(s, now + a + d); // D: 落到延音电平</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // S: 保持 s，直到 release 开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  g.setValueAtTime(s, now + dur);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  g.linearRampToValueAtTime(0, now + dur + r); // R: 释放消失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  osc.start(now);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  osc.stop(now + dur + r + 0.01);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>调包络的四个数就能让同一个波形听起来完全不同：极短 attack + 长 release 像拨弦，慢 attack 像弓拉弦，零 sustain 像打击乐。包络是合成器音色设计里最有表现力的一环——比换波形更能改变「这是什么乐器」的印象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"periodicwave-与加法合成\">PeriodicWave 与加法合成</h2><p>四种内置波形不够时，<code>PeriodicWave</code> 让你直接指定每个谐波的强度，浏览器据此合成一个自定义周期波。这就是<strong>加法合成</strong>的思想：任何周期声音都能拆成一组正弦谐波的叠加（傅里叶级数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>n</mi></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(t) = \\sum_n a_n \\sin(2\\pi n f_0 t + \\phi_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，你给出系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，就「画」出了音色。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 用前几个谐波近似一个温暖的管风琴音色&#10;const real = new Float32Array([0, 1, 0.5, 0, 0.3, 0, 0.15]); // 余弦项(谐波幅度)&#10;const imag = new Float32Array(real.length); // 正弦项, 这里全 0&#10;const wave = ctx.createPeriodicWave(real, imag, { disableNormalization: false });&#10;&#10;const osc = ctx.createOscillator();&#10;osc.setPeriodicWave(wave); // 用自定义波形替代 type&#10;osc.frequency.value = noteToFreq(0); // A4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 用前几个谐波近似一个温暖的管风琴音色</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const real = new Float32Array([0, 1, 0.5, 0, 0.3, 0, 0.15]); // 余弦项(谐波幅度)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const imag = new Float32Array(real.length); // 正弦项, 这里全 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const wave = ctx.createPeriodicWave(real, imag, { disableNormalization: false });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const osc = ctx.createOscillator();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>osc.setPeriodicWave(wave); // 用自定义波形替代 type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>osc.frequency.value = noteToFreq(0); // A4</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>real[n]</code>/<code>imag[n]</code> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个谐波的余弦/正弦分量。第 0 项是直流分量（恒为 0），第 1 项是基频，往后是 2、3、4 倍频。把高次谐波加重得到明亮音色，只留少数低次得到柔和音色。加法合成的好处是音色完全可控、可解释；代价是要还原复杂真实乐器需要很多谐波，这时往往改用采样（buffer source）更划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调制-颤音-抖音与-lfo\">调制：颤音、抖音与 LFO</h2><p>合成最迷人的部分是「用一个振荡器去控制另一个」。低频振荡器（LFO，几 Hz 的慢振荡）不直接发声，而是连到某个 AudioParam 上调制它——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/audio-graph-model\">音频图模型</a> 里讲的 <code>connect(audioParam)</code> 的舞台：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  LFO[&quot;LFO OscillatorNode&lt;br/&gt;5 Hz sine&quot;] --&gt; LG[&quot;GainNode&lt;br/&gt;调制深度&quot;]&#10;  LG --&gt;|connect 到参数| TGT[&quot;主 osc.detune&lt;br/&gt;(AudioParam)&quot;]&#10;  CAR[&quot;主 OscillatorNode&lt;br/&gt;440 Hz&quot;] --&gt; ENV[&quot;包络 GainNode&quot;]&#10;  ENV --&gt; OUT[&quot;destination&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  LFO[\"LFO OscillatorNode&lt;br/&gt;5 Hz sine\"] --&gt; LG[\"GainNode&lt;br/&gt;调制深度\"]\n  LG --&gt;|connect 到参数| TGT[\"主 osc.detune&lt;br/&gt;(AudioParam)\"]\n  CAR[\"主 OscillatorNode&lt;br/&gt;440 Hz\"] --&gt; ENV[\"包络 GainNode\"]\n  ENV --&gt; OUT[\"destination\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const lfo = ctx.createOscillator(); // 调制源&#10;lfo.frequency.value = 5; // 5 Hz&#10;const lfoGain = ctx.createGain();&#10;lfoGain.gain.value = 20; // 调制深度: ±20 cent&#10;lfo.connect(lfoGain).connect(carrier.detune); // 抖音(音高颤动)&#10;lfo.start();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const lfo = ctx.createOscillator(); // 调制源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lfo.frequency.value = 5; // 5 Hz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const lfoGain = ctx.createGain();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lfoGain.gain.value = 20; // 调制深度: ±20 cent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lfo.connect(lfoGain).connect(carrier.detune); // 抖音(音高颤动)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lfo.start();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LFO 连到 <code>detune</code> 得<strong>抖音</strong>（vibrato，音高周期性颤动），连到音量 GainNode 得<strong>颤音</strong>（tremolo，响度周期性起伏），连到滤波器 <code>frequency</code>（见 <a href=\"../nodes/gain-filter-nodes\">增益与滤波节点</a>）得「哇哇」的扫频。把振荡器、包络、滤波、LFO 这四样组合起来，就是一台减法合成器的雏形——而要做更复杂、内置节点凑不出的合成算法（如 FM、相位失真、物理建模），就该下放到 <a href=\"audio-worklet\">Audio Worklet 自定义处理</a> 里逐样本实现了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>OscillatorNode 凭数学波形凭空生成音调，由 <code>frequency</code>/<code>detune</code>/<code>type</code> 定义，与 buffer source 同为一次性。</li>\n<li>四种波形（正弦/方波/锯齿/三角）是基本调色板，谐波内容决定音色明暗；音高对数关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>440</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = 440 \\cdot 2^{n/12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">440</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把音名转频率。</li>\n<li>ADSR 包络（用 GainNode 自动化）让裸振荡器有起伏与生命，也避免开关爆音；它比换波形更能改变乐器印象。</li>\n<li>PeriodicWave 做加法合成：按傅里叶系数指定每个谐波强度，音色完全可控可解释。</li>\n<li>LFO 经 <code>connect(audioParam)</code> 调制其它参数：调 detune 得抖音、调音量得颤音、调滤波得扫频；更复杂的合成算法该下放到 AudioWorklet。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>振荡器也是一种源，与其它源的对照：<a href=\"../nodes/source-nodes\">源节点</a></li>\n<li>包络与 LFO 依赖的自动化与参数调制：<a href=\"../foundations/audio-graph-model\">音频图模型</a></li>\n<li>给合成音色加滤波塑形：<a href=\"../nodes/gain-filter-nodes\">增益与滤波节点</a></li>\n<li>内置节点凑不出的合成下放到代码：<a href=\"audio-worklet\">Audio Worklet 自定义处理</a></li>\n<li>跨库：高性能 DSP 算法用 WASM 实现，见 <a href=\"../../webassembly/real-world-applications/game-and-creative\">WebAssembly · 游戏与创意应用</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"振荡器合成","id":"振荡器合成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"包络：让音符有生命","id":"包络-让音符有生命"},{"level":2,"text":"PeriodicWave 与加法合成","id":"periodicwave-与加法合成"},{"level":2,"text":"调制：颤音、抖音与 LFO","id":"调制-颤音-抖音与-lfo"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"分析与可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/nodes/analyser-visualization"},"next":{"title":"效果与卷积混响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/synthesis/effects-convolution"}}